                                                            <i class="meta-item-icon icon-bed" style="color:forestgreen"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="meta-icon-container" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path class="meta-icon" fill="#0DBAE8" d="M21 48.001h-19c-1.104 0-2-.896-2-2v-31c0-1.104.896-2 2-2h19c1.106 0 2 .896 2 2v31c0 1.104-.895 2-2 2zm0-37.001h-19c-1.104 0-2-.895-2-1.999v-7.001c0-1.104.896-2 2-2h19c1.106 0 2 .896 2 2v7.001c0 1.104-.895 1.999-2 1.999zm25 37.001h-19c-1.104 0-2-.896-2-2v-31c0-1.104.896-2 2-2h19c1.104 0 2 .896 2 2v31c0 1.104-.896 2-2 2zm0-37.001h-19c-1.104 0-2-.895-2-1.999v-7.001c0-1.104.896-2 2-2h19c1.104 0 2 .896 2 2v7.001c0 1.104-.896 1.999-2 1.999z"></path></svg></i>
                                                            <div class="meta-inner-wrapper">
